* 3, 5, or 7 mins.\n* **Atmospheric Modes:** Morning, Evening, and Night.\n* **Stats:** Real-time distance and calorie tracking.\n\n**Find your flow today with Fit River XR .**\n", "short_description": "Fit River XR: Mindful VR Rowing Escape to serene rivers. A peaceful rowing experience with no forced rhythms\u2014just you and the water.\n\nFitness on Your Terms Set your timer and pick a session for your day:\n\n\u30fb3, 5, or 7 Minutes: Pick your duration.\n\u30fbAtmospheric Modes: Morning mist, Evening, or Night.\n\nReal Results Engage your core and arms with real rowing. Track distance and calories in real-time. Low impact, high reward.\n\nFind your flow with Fit River XR.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "33158524860457511"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "911587968209083"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "911587968209083"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1768789200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "911587968209083"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__ty